
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Two weeks ago, Bjarne and I and lots of ISO committee members had a blast at the <strong>code::dive C++ conference</strong> held on November 25, just two days after the end of <a href="https://herbsutter.com/2024/11/24/wg21-2024-11/">the Wrocław ISO C++ meeting</a>. Thanks again to Nokia for hosting the ISO meeting, and for inviting us all to speak at their conference! My talk was an updated-and-shortened version of my CppCon keynote (which I also gave at Meeting C++; I&#8217;ll post a link to that video too once it&#8217;s posted):</p>



